00:38:46.010 --> 00:38:47.020
Wow, that's cool.

00:38:47.020 --> 00:38:47.800
Nine seconds.

00:38:47.800 --> 00:38:51.500
130 gigabyte is maybe
not that impressive.

00:38:51.500 --> 00:38:56.410
Let's see how that is if we look
over the entire year so far.

00:38:56.410 --> 00:38:59.650
So its from 1st of
January until today.

00:38:59.650 --> 00:39:01.570
Again, you see
there in this query

00:39:01.570 --> 00:39:04.180
