00:39:04.180 --> 00:39:06.040
Now, I'm caching.

00:39:06.040 --> 00:39:07.360
I don't want to cache.

00:39:07.360 --> 00:39:09.510
Let me uncache.

00:39:09.510 --> 00:39:11.220
And let me run this again.

00:39:11.220 --> 00:39:12.490
Hide the options.

00:39:12.490 --> 00:39:15.970
So basically, I'm
looking, again,

00:39:15.970 --> 00:39:19.040
for the same happiness
in the article.

00:39:19.040 --> 00:39:21.790
And I'm running that
for the entire data

00:39:21.790 --> 00:39:23.860
