00:39:23.860 --> 00:39:26.495
And I'm doing on each
of the titles a regex.

00:39:26.495 --> 00:39:29.770
A regex, it's not
so straightforward.

00:39:29.770 --> 00:39:31.520
You actually have to
look into the data.

00:39:31.520 --> 00:39:35.590
And you can't use an index or
